{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1217","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1217","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1217\",\"parent_revision\":\"918e892a588f9db4287002b8b03864c65c0269dd\",\"root_revision\":\"c39bb18c0b82065a51839ac74a52dc988f64b045e0bf0688df4b4c6105b97ca3\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Refactor\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nFour verified disconnects in the plugin-creator refactor workflow (assessor \u2192 implement-refactor \u2192 start-refactor-task \u2192 ensure-complete), identified by reading source files on 2026-02-09.\\n\\nD1: Assessor creates TaskCreate entries (lines 26-44 of assessor/SKILL.md) but sub-agent prompts at lines 51-134, 175-336, 377-552, 600-646 do not pass task IDs. Tasks become invisible to sub-agents.\\n\\nD2: Inconsistent tracking API \u2014 assessor uses TaskCreate, implement-refactor and ensure-complete use TodoWrite for the same purpose within one workflow.\\n\\nD3: implement-refactor checks for task status \u2705 COMPLETE (lines 109-116) but does not instruct sub-agents to call `/start-refactor-task --complete {id}`, so completion is never signalled.\\n\\nD4: TaskCreate entries used by assessor are session-scoped and do not survive context compaction. Long-running assessor sessions lose progress tracking.\\n\\nImpact: Refactor workflows produce incomplete or invisible task tracking. Observed during holistic-linting refactor (score 68\u219292) where TaskCreate entries showed stale state despite successful completion.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAssessment date: 2026-04-23\\n\\n| # | Condition | Status | Source |\\n|---|-----------|--------|--------|\\n| 1 | assessor/SKILL.md with TaskCreate at lines 26-44 and subagent prompts 51-134, 175-336, 377-552, 600-646 | AVAILABLE | Item description with exact line numbers |\\n| 2 | implement-refactor and ensure-complete skills using TodoWrite | AVAILABLE | Item description |\\n| 3 | `/start-refactor-task --complete` command exists | DERIVABLE | Check `plugins/plugin-creator/commands/start-refactor-task.md` |\\n| 4 | Durable task state format (SAM or backlog) | AVAILABLE | SAM task files established in development-harness |\\n\\nVerdict: READY \u2014 all information available with exact line numbers provided.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **plugin-creator refactor workflow has 4 disconnects between steps** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Research investigation \u2014 refactor-workflow-disconnects.md, 2026-02-09\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-04-01\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP2 Refactor. Affects plugin-creator refactor workflow skill instructions. Medium complexity. No code changes \u2014 instruction files only.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- D1 fixed: assessor TaskCreate IDs passed to all 4 subagent prompt blocks at lines 51-134, 175-336, 377-552, 600-646 of assessor/SKILL.md\\n- D2 fixed: all workflow stages use consistent tracking API (either all TaskCreate or all TodoWrite \u2014 choose one and remove the other)\\n- D3 fixed: subagents instructed to call `/start-refactor-task --complete {id}` on task completion so ensure-complete can verify\\n- D4 fixed: task state persisted in a durable format (SAM task file or backlog item) that survives context compaction\\n- Regression: holistic-linting refactor workflow (score 68\u219292 test case) produces correct task completion tracking\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/refactor-planner/SKILL.md` (assessor) \u2014 fix lines 26-44, 51-134, 175-336, 377-552, 600-646\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/refactor-executor/SKILL.md` (implement-refactor) \u2014 standardize tracking API\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/skills/refactor-validator/SKILL.md` (ensure-complete) \u2014 standardize tracking API\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/commands/start-refactor-task.md` \u2014 verify --complete flag exists\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a plugin-creator refactor workflow user, I need the 4 verified disconnects in the assessor\u2192implement-refactor\u2192start-refactor-task\u2192ensure-complete pipeline fixed so task IDs are visible to subagents, tracking APIs are consistent, completion is signalled, and progress survives context compaction.\\n\",\"digest\":\"e0a5b137e2d80f82c1a74449ec34a42f5b67b519199c25818efc4c13aefbcdea\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPg5Kig\"}"}